{"version":1,"content":"<p>10⽉29⽇是世界中風關注⽇，香港中風學會提出新的中風中文口訣「重視談笑⽤兵」，涵蓋中風會出現的平衡、視力、言語、面容及肢體症狀，呼籲市民一旦出現有關症狀，應及時就醫。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:42:48.700706+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:43:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:12.621338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:38:18.069603+00:00","content_hash":"d409d282da73374423f21e632b5968b8b8ee8c03f2e76a734f6d6f5ec40f67f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}